{
  "version": 1,
  "source": "docs/workflows/team.md",
  "description": "Quality gate G8 (ownership): path globs -> owner, derived from the ownership table and Rules in docs/workflows/team.md, which stays the source of truth (change team.md first, then this file). Checked by tools/check_ownership.py; owned by FORGE-05.",
  "syntax": "Paths are relative to the repository root with '/' separators. '*' and '?' match within one path segment; '**' matches zero or more whole segments. The most specific pattern wins: an exact file (no wildcard) beats any wildcard pattern; otherwise the pattern with more literal (wildcard-free) segments wins; then the longer literal prefix; a remaining tie between patterns that can match the same path is an error in this file. A path no pattern matches belongs to default_owner.",
  "default_owner": "forge-00",
  "owners": [
    "forge-00",
    "forge-01",
    "forge-02",
    "forge-03",
    "forge-04",
    "forge-05",
    "forge-06",
    "codex"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "intelligence/** and prompts/** are Codex's: the Codex row (and the FORGE-05 prompt) give them to Codex, superseding FORGE-00's 'intelligence/ (until Codex is live)'. A FORGE-00 change there is flagged.",
    "roblox/tests/unit/contracts/**, roblox/tests/fixtures/** and roblox.yml are harness/tooling files FORGE-05 maintains (also listed in team.md's FORGE-05 row). .gitattributes has no team.md row; it is assigned to forge-05 here as repository tooling (line-ending policy CI depends on). Add it to team.md.",
    "Brace sets in team.md ({Data,Player,...}*) are expanded to one glob per name. '*' matches one path segment, so they cover single-file modules (Services/DataService.luau) but not folder modules (Services/DataService/init.luau): add a '<Name>*/**' row when an area needs one.",
    "Per-area game config files match games/*/config/<Name>.luau in every game folder. Everything else in games/sandbox/ is forge-05. Other games/game-00N/ paths stay with forge-00 (it creates them) until the game brief reassigns sub-folders: add rows then.",
    "Unlisted paths belong to forge-00, e.g. README.md, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/architecture/interfaces.md, docs/standards/, tools/forge.py, tools/tests/test_forge.py, tools/setup/, production/handoffs/TEMPLATE.md, agents/*/STATUS.md. New handoffs and each agent's own STATUS.md are opened up by the exceptions below.",
    "Shared contracts (roblox/src/shared/Contracts/ -> forge-05 as custodian, docs/architecture/interfaces.md -> forge-00) are flagged when another worker edits them; AGENTS.md requires FORGE-05 review and FORGE-00 approval for those PRs, recorded on the PR.",
    "game-001 rows come from the 'game-001 — AI Kingdoms' section of team.md (D-020, D-022): 'src/' = games/game-001/src/, 'config' = games/game-001/config/. Two FORGE-05 rows (now also in team.md): games/game-001/config/Game.luau (game id + display name, read by Studio smoke test S1, like games/sandbox/config/Game.luau) and games/game-001/**/.gitkeep (empty-folder placeholders the Rojo project needs before workers add code; any more specific row still wins).",
    "Name prefixes compete by literal prefix: games/game-001/src/server/Services/MatchAnalytics* (forge-04) beats Match* (forge-01) for MatchAnalyticsService.luau.",
    "games/game-001/world/.gitkeep (exact file, forge-05): the empty-folder placeholder that lets the game project mount world/ -> ReplicatedStorage.Game.World before FORGE-02's first world file (Rojo fails on a missing $path; FL-0067). Everything else in world/ is forge-02's.",
    "games/game-001/src/server/Services/DebugPreset* (forge-05): the Studio-only VS-1 debug presets of CONTRACTS G13.7 (rep.set, citizen.request, kingdom.setFed, strike.start, population.reseed; FL-0093, D-030). They reach other workers' services only through the registry.",
    "Crown Arena rows (D-029, VS-2) added by FORGE-00 on 2026-10-12 from team.md: Arena shared folder, Leadership/Support/Arena/Duel services, Duel/ArenaState controllers and Support/Arena/Duel config -> forge-01; SupportMeter/PerkPicker/Loadout/ArenaIntro/ArenaHud/LeadershipRecap/Petition controllers -> forge-03; Crowd/Chant controllers and Crowd config -> forge-04; tests/fairness -> forge-05; design/crown-arena.md -> forge-00.",
    "Living-kingdom rows (D-030) added by FORGE-00 on 2026-10-12 from team.md: Population/Conversation/Reputation/Consequence services and Society config -> forge-01; Conversation/ReputationPanel/PlotPicker/UpgradePanel controllers -> forge-03; CitizenBubble controllers -> forge-04; tests/balance -> forge-05; content library, generated src/shared/Content, tests/content, tools/content and design/living-kingdom.md -> forge-00.",
    "FORGE-06 (dialogue and content, D-035) added by FORGE-00 on 2026-10-13: content/dialogue/** and content/citizens/** plus the six generated data modules derived from them -> forge-06; content/reputation/**, SPEC.md, README.md, ContentQuery.luau, Reputation.luau, tests/content and tools/content stay forge-00."
  ],
